text: ['Destroy target nonlegendary creature.', 'Scry 1.\\nDraw a card.', "Shanna, Sisay's Legacy can't be the target of abilities your opponents control.\\nShanna gets +1/+1 for each creature you control.", "Steel Leaf Champion can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.", 'When Zhalfirin Void enters the battlefield, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "You may pay {3}{U} and tap an untapped artifact you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFlying", '{T}: Add {G}.']
flavor: ['"I am heir to many treasures. None is as precious as knowing how my ancestor lived her life."', '"I do as I please, little mortal. Do go on about your wishes, though—they amuse me to no end."', '"The wind whispers, \'come home,\' but I cannot."\\n—Teferi', '"Your life is finished, your name lost, and your work forgotten. It is as though Mazeura never existed."\\n—*Chainer\'s Torment*', "The crystal pulsed with the power of Teferi's planeswalker spark. Had Jhoira given him a blessing or a curse?"]
